=== Alignment Math Verification ===
Test Rect: 0 0 200 100
Font Size: 16.0
Expected font metrics (from 16px font):
  ascender:  ~12.56
  descender: ~3.44
  lineHeight: 16.0

Horizontal Alignment (X-axis):
  Left:   x = rect.minX = 0.0
  Center: x = rect.midX = 100.0
  Right:  x = rect.maxX = 200.0

Vertical Alignment (Y-axis) for single line:
  Top:      y = ascender = 12.56
  Middle:   y = height / 2 = 100 / 2 = 50
  Bottom:   y = height - descender = 100 - 3.44 = 96.56
  Baseline: y = ascender = 12.56 (same as Top for a single row)

For multi-line (3 lines, lineHeight=16):
  rowsHeight = 16 * 3 = 48
  Top:      y = ascender = 12.56
  Middle:   y = (height - rowsHeight) / 2 + ascender = (100 - 48) / 2 + 12.56 = 38.56
  Bottom:   y = height - rowsHeight + ascender = 100 - 48 + 12.56 = 64.56
  Baseline: y = (height - rowsHeight + lineHeight) / 2 = (100 - 48 + 16) / 2 = 34

